#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:9
msgid "PhysX Backend (Isaac Sim)"
msgstr "PhysX 后端（Isaac Sim）"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:11
msgid ""
"The PhysX backend runs NVIDIA PhysX inside Isaac Sim, on the Omniverse Kit "
"runtime. Its integration lives in the ``isaaclab_physx`` package. This page "
"explains how that package starts Kit, owns the simulation lifecycle, "
"configures the PhysX scene, and exposes native PhysX data to Isaac Lab "
"assets and sensors. For solver selection and tuning, see :ref:`physics-"
"backends-physx` and :ref:`physx-solver-tuning`. For the kit-less PhysX path,"
" see :ref:`ovphysx-backend`."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 后端在基于 Omniverse Kit 运行时的 Isaac Sim 内运行 NVIDIA PhysX，其集成代码位于 "
"``isaaclab_physx`` 软件包。本页介绍该软件包如何启动 Kit、管理仿真生命周期、配置 PhysX 场景，以及向 Isaac Lab "
"资产和传感器提供原生 PhysX 数据。求解器选择与调优见 :ref:`physics-backends-physx` 和 :ref:`physx-"
"solver-tuning` 。不依赖 Kit 的 PhysX 路径见 :ref:`ovphysx-backend` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:21
msgid "Selecting the backend"
msgstr "选择后端"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:23
msgid ""
"Configure the backend with :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` on "
":attr:`isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.physics`, or select it from the command "
"line with ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` when the task exposes that preset:"
msgstr ""
"在 :attr:`isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.physics` 中设置 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` ，即可配置该后端。如果任务提供相应预设，也可以通过命令行参数 "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 选择它："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:34
msgid ""
"The ``physx`` selector is automatic. It selects a "
":class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysxAutoCfg` that holds a ``PhysxCfg`` and, when "
"the task supports it, an :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg`. When the "
"simulation is launched, the auto configuration resolves to Isaac Sim PhysX "
"if the run needs Kit, and otherwise to OvPhysX when one is configured. Use "
"``isaacsim_physx`` to require the Isaac Sim path."
msgstr ""
"``physx`` 选择器会自动选择后端。它选用的 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysxAutoCfg` 包含一个 "
"``PhysxCfg``；任务支持时，还会包含 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` "
"。启动仿真时，如果运行需要 Kit，自动配置会解析为 Isaac Sim PhysX；否则，在配置了 OvPhysX 的情况下会解析为 "
"OvPhysX。使用 ``isaacsim_physx`` 可明确指定 Isaac Sim 路径。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:43
msgid "Runtime: Isaac Sim and Kit"
msgstr "运行时：Isaac Sim 与 Kit"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:46
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:48
msgid ""
"``PhysxCfg`` names its launcher through the ``launcher_type`` class "
"attribute, which is ``isaaclab_physx.app:KitLauncher``. "
":func:`~isaaclab.app.launch_simulation` scans the resolved configuration, "
"collects the launchers that the physics and renderer configurations name, "
"and starts them. Kit starts first. Scripts do not construct the launcher "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"``PhysxCfg`` 通过类属性 ``launcher_type`` 指定启动器，其值为 "
"``isaaclab_physx.app:KitLauncher``。:func:`~isaaclab.app.launch_simulation` "
"遍历解析后的配置，收集物理和渲染器配置指定的启动器，然后依次启动，Kit 最先启动。脚本无需自行创建启动器。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:55
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` creates the Isaac Sim "
"``SimulationApp``. Unless ``--experience`` is passed, it selects an Isaac "
"Lab experience file from the repository ``apps/`` directory based on the "
"headless, camera-rendering, livestream, and XR settings, for example "
"``isaaclab.python.headless.kit`` or ``isaaclab.python.rendering.kit``. After"
" startup it publishes Isaac Lab settings such as ``/isaaclab/has_gui`` that "
"the simulation context and renderers read. The launcher's environment "
"variables and arguments are documented in :mod:`isaaclab_physx.app`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` 创建 Isaac Sim 的 "
"``SimulationApp``。未传入 ``--experience`` 时，它会根据无界面运行、相机渲染、视频流和 XR 设置，从仓库的 "
"``apps/`` 目录中选择 Isaac Lab experience 文件，例如 ``isaaclab.python.headless.kit`` "
"或 ``isaaclab.python.rendering.kit``。启动后，它会发布 ``/isaaclab/has_gui`` 等 Isaac "
"Lab 设置，供仿真上下文和渲染器读取。启动器的环境变量和参数见 :mod:`isaaclab_physx.app` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:65
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "USD 场景"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:67
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab owns the USD stage. Kit extensions, including PhysX, its tensor "
"views, and the viewport, read the stage from Kit's USD context instead. When"
" Kit is running, :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext` registers a "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitStageBackendCfg`, and "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitStageBackend` attaches the simulation stage "
"to ``omni.usd``'s context. Closing that backend closes the Kit stage before "
"the simulation clears its stage cache."
msgstr ""
"USD 场景由 Isaac Lab 管理。PhysX、其张量视图和视口等 Kit 扩展则从 Kit 的 USD 上下文中读取场景。Kit "
"运行时，:class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext` 注册 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitStageBackendCfg` ，由 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitStageBackend` 将仿真场景接入 ``omni.usd`` "
"上下文。关闭该后端时，会先关闭 Kit 场景，再由仿真清理场景缓存。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:76
msgid "Interaction with Isaac Sim's simulation manager"
msgstr "与 Isaac Sim 仿真管理器的交互"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:78
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` is the single owner of the "
"simulation lifecycle. Isaac Sim's own "
"``isaacsim.core.simulation_manager.SimulationManager`` registers default "
"timeline and stage callbacks. Its stop callback invalidates the shared "
"``omni.physics.tensors`` simulation view, which would also invalidate the "
"views that Isaac Lab assets hold. ``KitLauncher`` asks Isaac Sim to skip "
"these callbacks at startup through the "
"``/exts/isaacsim.core.simulation_manager/enable_default_callbacks`` setting."
" Newer Isaac Sim versions honor it, and Isaac Lab then leaves the manager "
"untouched. On older versions, ``PhysxManager.initialize()`` disables those "
"callbacks and redirects the module's ``SimulationManager`` to "
"``PhysxManager``. ``PhysxManager`` re-applies this patch if the Isaac Sim "
"extension is enabled later."
msgstr ""
"仿真生命周期统一由 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` 管理。Isaac Sim 自带的 "
"``isaacsim.core.simulation_manager.SimulationManager`` "
"会注册默认的时间线和场景回调。其中，停止回调会使共享的 ``omni.physics.tensors`` 仿真视图失效，连带使 Isaac Lab "
"资产持有的视图失效。``KitLauncher`` 在启动时通过 "
"``/exts/isaacsim.core.simulation_manager/enable_default_callbacks`` 设置，要求 "
"Isaac Sim 跳过这些回调。较新的 Isaac Sim 版本会遵循该设置，Isaac Lab "
"因而无需修改其管理器。对于较旧的版本，``PhysxManager.initialize()`` 会禁用这些回调，并将模块中的 "
"``SimulationManager`` 重定向到 ``PhysxManager``。如果之后才启用 Isaac Sim "
"扩展，``PhysxManager`` 会重新应用这一补丁。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:94
msgid "Simulation lifecycle"
msgstr "仿真生命周期"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:96
msgid ""
"``PhysxManager`` implements the shared "
":class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` contract on top of the "
"``omni.physx``, ``omni.physics.tensors``, and ``omni.timeline`` interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"``PhysxManager`` 基于 ``omni.physx``、``omni.physics.tensors`` 和 "
"``omni.timeline`` 接口，实现公共的 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` 接口约定："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:111
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:112
msgid ""
"Applies Kit physics settings such as the CUDA device and GPU readback "
"suppression, authors the PhysX scene attributes described in `Scene "
"configuration`_, binds a default physics material, and loads or unloads the "
"PhysX Fabric extension."
msgstr ""
"设置 CUDA 设备、是否禁止 GPU 数据回读等 Kit 物理选项，写入 `场景配置 <Scene configuration_>`_ 中介绍的 "
"PhysX 场景属性，绑定默认物理材质，并加载或卸载 PhysX Fabric 扩展。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:117
msgid "First reset"
msgstr "首次重置"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:118
msgid ""
"Attaches the stage to PhysX (on CPU, PhysX instead loads the scene directly "
"from USD), runs one warm-start update, and dispatches the warm-up event. It "
"then registers a :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxBackendCfg` with the "
"simulation context. The resulting ``PhysxBackend`` owns the "
"``omni.physics.tensors`` simulation view, created with the Warp frontend for"
" the current stage. Finally, the manager dispatches ``PHYSICS_READY``, and "
"assets and sensors create their typed views from the simulation view."
msgstr ""
"将场景接入 PhysX；在 CPU 模式下，PhysX 会直接从 USD 加载场景。随后执行一次热启动更新并触发预热事件，再向仿真上下文注册 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxBackendCfg` 。由此创建的 ``PhysxBackend`` 管理 "
"``omni.physics.tensors`` 仿真视图，该视图针对当前场景创建，使用 Warp 前端。最后，管理器触发 "
"``PHYSICS_READY``，资产和传感器据此从仿真视图创建各自类型的视图。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:128
msgid "Step"
msgstr "仿真步进"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:129
msgid ""
"Advances PhysX through the ``omni.physx`` simulation interface with "
"``simulate(dt)`` followed by ``fetch_results()``. Physics stepping does not "
"pump the Kit application. Rendering is driven separately by the simulation "
"context. ``forward()`` refreshes articulation kinematics through the tensor "
"view only when pose writes have marked them dirty."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``omni.physx`` 仿真接口推进 PhysX：先调用 ``simulate(dt)``，再调用 "
"``fetch_results()``。物理步进不会驱动 Kit "
"应用更新，渲染由仿真上下文单独驱动。仅当写入位姿使关节系统的运动学状态被标记为需要更新时，``forward()`` 才会通过张量视图刷新这些状态。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:135
msgid "Timeline and teardown"
msgstr "时间线与资源释放"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:136
msgid ""
"``play()``, ``pause()``, and ``stop()`` drive ``omni.timeline`` and pump one"
" Kit update so timeline callbacks run synchronously. Stopping the timeline "
"invalidates every tensor view. The next play or reset warms up PhysX and "
"creates the views again. ``close()`` detaches PhysX from the stage before "
"views are invalidated and prims are deleted."
msgstr ""
"``play()``、``pause()`` 和 ``stop()`` 驱动 ``omni.timeline``，并执行一次 Kit "
"更新，使时间线回调同步运行。停止时间线会使所有张量视图失效。下一次播放或重置会重新预热 PhysX 并创建视图。``close()`` 会先将 "
"PhysX 从场景中分离，再使视图失效并删除 prim。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:143
msgid "Lifecycle events"
msgstr "生命周期事件"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:145
msgid ""
"Backend-agnostic code registers callbacks with "
":class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent`. ``PhysxManager`` maps those events "
"to its PhysX-specific :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.IsaacEvents`, which "
"remain available for backward compatibility:"
msgstr ""
"与后端无关的代码通过 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent` 注册回调。``PhysxManager`` "
"将这些事件映射到 PhysX 专用的 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.IsaacEvents` "
"；后者仍保留，以兼容旧版代码："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:154
msgid "``PhysicsEvent``"
msgstr "``PhysicsEvent``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:155
msgid "``IsaacEvents``"
msgstr "``IsaacEvents``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:156
msgid "Dispatched"
msgstr "触发时机"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:157
msgid "``MODEL_INIT``"
msgstr "``MODEL_INIT``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:158
msgid "``PHYSICS_WARMUP``"
msgstr "``PHYSICS_WARMUP``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:159
msgid "After the warm-start update"
msgstr "热启动更新完成后"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:160
#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:161
msgid "``PHYSICS_READY``"
msgstr "``PHYSICS_READY``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:162
msgid "After the tensor view exists"
msgstr "张量视图创建完成后"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:163
msgid "``STOP``"
msgstr "``STOP``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:164
msgid "``TIMELINE_STOP``"
msgstr "``TIMELINE_STOP``"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:165
msgid "When the timeline stops"
msgstr "时间线停止时"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:167
msgid ""
"``IsaacEvents`` also exposes ``PRE_PHYSICS_STEP`` and ``POST_PHYSICS_STEP`` "
"through the ``omni.physx`` step subscription, and ``PRIM_DELETION`` during "
"teardown. New code should prefer ``PhysicsEvent``."
msgstr ""
"``IsaacEvents`` 还通过 ``omni.physx`` 的步进订阅提供 ``PRE_PHYSICS_STEP`` 和 "
"``POST_PHYSICS_STEP``，并在释放资源时触发 ``PRIM_DELETION``。新代码应优先使用 ``PhysicsEvent``。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:173
msgid "Scene configuration"
msgstr "场景配置"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:175
msgid ""
"``PhysxCfg`` fields are written to the physics scene prim at "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.physics_prim_path`. The manager applies "
"``PhysxSceneAPI`` and sets each remaining field as a ``physxScene:`` "
"attribute in camel case, for example ``gpu_max_rigid_contact_count`` becomes"
" ``physxScene:gpuMaxRigidContactCount``. Some fields are translated instead "
"of copied:"
msgstr ""
"``PhysxCfg`` 字段会写入 :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.physics_prim_path` "
"指定的物理场景 prim。管理器应用 ``PhysxSceneAPI``，将其余字段转换为驼峰命名的 ``physxScene:`` 属性，例如将 "
"``gpu_max_rigid_contact_count`` 写为 "
"``physxScene:gpuMaxRigidContactCount``。部分字段会进行转换，而非直接复制："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:182
msgid ""
"``solver_type`` becomes ``physxScene:solverType`` (``\"TGS\"`` or "
"``\"PGS\"``)."
msgstr "``solver_type`` 转换为 ``physxScene:solverType``（``\"TGS\"`` 或 ``\"PGS\"``）。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:183
msgid "``bounce_threshold_velocity`` becomes ``physxScene:bounceThreshold``."
msgstr "``bounce_threshold_velocity`` 转换为 ``physxScene:bounceThreshold``。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:184
msgid "The timestep becomes ``physxScene:timeStepsPerSecond``."
msgstr "时间步长转换为 ``physxScene:timeStepsPerSecond``。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:185
msgid ""
"GPU simulation enables GPU dynamics and the GPU broadphase. CPU simulation "
"uses the MBP broadphase."
msgstr "GPU 仿真启用 GPU 动力学和 GPU 粗略碰撞检测；CPU 仿真使用 MBP 粗略碰撞检测。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:187
msgid ""
"``enable_ccd`` takes effect only on CPU. CCD is disabled with a warning when"
" GPU dynamics is enabled."
msgstr "``enable_ccd`` 仅在 CPU 模式下生效。启用 GPU 动力学时，CCD 会被禁用，并给出警告。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:189
msgid ""
"The backend-agnostic ``deterministic`` request enables "
"``enable_enhanced_determinism``."
msgstr "与后端无关的 ``deterministic`` 选项会启用 ``enable_enhanced_determinism``。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:191
msgid ""
"Scene query support follows ``SimulationCfg.enable_scene_query_support`` and"
" is forced on when Kit runs with a GUI."
msgstr ""
"场景查询遵循 ``SimulationCfg.enable_scene_query_support`` 设置；Kit "
"以图形界面模式运行时，会强制开启场景查询。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:194
msgid ""
"Per-prim physics properties are not part of ``PhysxCfg``. They are authored "
"through the USD schema configurations described in "
":doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs`. PhysX-only schema configurations, such "
"as :class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas.PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`, live in"
" :mod:`isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`."
msgstr ""
"各 prim 的物理属性不属于 ``PhysxCfg``，而是通过 :doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs` 中介绍的 "
"USD schema "
"配置写入。:class:`~isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas.PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg` 等 "
"PhysX 专用 schema 配置位于 :mod:`isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:201
msgid "Fabric"
msgstr "Fabric"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:203
msgid ""
"When :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.use_fabric` is ``True``, the "
"default, the manager enables the ``omni.physx.fabric`` extension. It also "
"turns off PhysX write-back to USD (``/physics/updateToUsd`` and related "
"settings), so simulated transforms reach the renderer through Fabric instead"
" of USD. With ``use_fabric=False``, PhysX writes simulation results back to "
"USD, which is slower for large scenes."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg.use_fabric` 为 ``True`` 时（默认值），管理器启用 "
"``omni.physx.fabric`` 扩展，并关闭 PhysX 向 USD 回写数据的设置（``/physics/updateToUsd`` "
"及相关选项）。因此，仿真变换通过 Fabric 而非 USD 传递给渲染器。设置 ``use_fabric=False`` 时，PhysX "
"会将仿真结果回写到 USD，在大型场景中会更慢。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:214
msgid "Tensor views and native access"
msgstr "张量视图与原生接口访问"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:216
msgid ""
"The PhysX Tensor API provides typed views for data paths and capabilities "
"that require engine-native access."
msgstr "PhysX 张量 API 为需要引擎原生访问的数据路径和功能提供类型化视图。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:219
msgid ""
"Every PhysX asset and sensor in ``isaaclab_physx``, except "
"``SurfaceGripper``, is built on typed views created from the shared "
"``omni.physics.tensors`` simulation view:"
msgstr ""
"除 ``SurfaceGripper`` 外，``isaaclab_physx`` 中的所有 PhysX "
"资产和传感器都基于相应类型的视图实现，这些视图从共享的 ``omni.physics.tensors`` 仿真视图创建："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:227
msgid "Isaac Lab class"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 类"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:228
msgid "Native view"
msgstr "原生视图"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:229
msgid "Articulation, joint wrench sensor"
msgstr "关节系统、关节力旋量传感器"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:230
msgid "Articulation view"
msgstr "关节系统视图"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:231
msgid "Rigid object, rigid object collection"
msgstr "刚体对象、刚体对象集合"

