#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:237
msgid "IMU, frame transformer, ray caster, and similar sensors"
msgstr "IMU、坐标系变换器、射线投射器等传感器"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:238
msgid "Rigid-body view of the tracked bodies"
msgstr "所跟踪刚体的刚体视图"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:240
msgid ""
"Assets expose their view through ``root_view``. The contact sensor exposes "
"its rigid-contact view through ``contact_view``. Use "
":meth:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager.get_physics_sim_view` to reach "
"the simulation view itself after the first reset."
msgstr ""
"资产通过 ``root_view`` 提供自身的视图，接触传感器通过 ``contact_view`` 提供刚体接触视图。首次重置后，可以用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager.get_physics_sim_view` 获取仿真视图本身。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:245
msgid ""
"Environment cloning uses "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.cloner.PhysxReplicateContext`, which applies the "
"clone plan through the ``omni.physx`` replicator interface."
msgstr ""
"环境克隆使用 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.cloner.PhysxReplicateContext` ，通过 "
"``omni.physx`` 的复制器接口执行克隆计划。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:250
msgid "Mental model"
msgstr "基本概念"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:252
msgid ""
"The API starts from a ``SimulationView`` and creates typed views over "
"selected physics objects. Access is entirely method-based: a getter pulls "
"data from the view, and an independent setter publishes data back. Returned "
"buffers are not live pointers, so editing a getter result does not update "
"the simulation. Raw views select objects with PhysX Tensor API wildcard "
"patterns."
msgstr ""
"API 从 ``SimulationView`` 开始，为选定物理对象创建类型化视图。访问完全通过方法进行：getter 从视图读取数据，独立的 "
"setter 将数据写回。返回的缓冲区不是实时指针，因此修改 getter 的返回值不会更新仿真。原始视图通过 PhysX 张量 API "
"通配模式选择对象。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:259
msgid "Lifecycle prerequisite"
msgstr "生命周期前提"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:261
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` creates its ``SimulationView``"
" with the Warp frontend. Low-level code must run only after physics "
"initialization and simulation reset, when the PhysX Tensor API view has been"
" created:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxManager` 使用 Warp 前端创建 "
"``SimulationView`` 。底层代码只能在物理初始化和仿真重置之后运行，此时 PhysX 张量 API 视图已经创建："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:275
msgid "Reuse Isaac Lab-owned access"
msgstr "复用 Isaac Lab 持有的访问对象"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:277
msgid ""
"When an Isaac Lab asset already has the desired selection, reuse its "
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.Articulation.root_view` rather than creating a"
" second view:"
msgstr ""
"如果 Isaac Lab 资源已经包含所需选择，复用它的 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.Articulation.root_view` ，不要再创建第二个视图："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:287
msgid ""
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.Articulation.root_view` is backend-specific "
"and typed. An articulation, rigid object, rigid-object collection, or "
"deformable can expose a different native PhysX view type, so choose methods "
"that match the returned view rather than assuming one common interface."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.Articulation.root_view` "
"是后端专用的类型化视图。关节体、刚体对象、刚体对象集合或可变形体可能暴露不同的原生 PhysX "
"视图类型，应使用与返回视图匹配的方法，不要假定它们具有同一种接口。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:293
msgid "Create raw access"
msgstr "创建底层访问"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:295
msgid ""
"Create a view directly only when no Isaac Lab-owned selection matches the "
"needed objects or capability. In this Tensor API pattern, ``*`` selects the "
"matching object below every cloned environment:"
msgstr ""
"只有现有 Isaac Lab 选择无法匹配所需对象或功能时，才直接创建视图。在以下 Tensor API 模式中， ``*`` "
"选择每个克隆环境下的匹配对象："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:306
msgid "Read/write semantics"
msgstr "读写语义"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:308
msgid ""
"Each getter and setter is a separate operation. Clone a returned Warp buffer"
" before editing it locally, then call the matching setter to publish the "
"result:"
msgstr "每个 getter 和 setter 都是独立操作。本地修改前，先克隆返回的 Warp 缓冲区，再调用对应 setter 写回结果："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:323
msgid ""
"Cloning makes ownership explicit. Callers can modify the clone with Warp "
"before the setter, but edits to a local buffer do not publish themselves. "
"The ``indices`` array selects the complete view and matches the setter's "
"required ``int32`` dtype and device; the setter performs the write. For "
"active Tensor API contracts that require link transforms to be refreshed "
"after joint-state writes, call ``update_articulations_kinematic()``. Not "
"every setter requires that refresh; follow the method-level behavior in the "
"upstream reference."
msgstr ""
"克隆使所有权明确。调用方可在 setter 之前通过 Warp 修改克隆副本，但本地缓冲区的修改不会自动写回。 ``indices`` "
"数组选择完整视图，且符合 setter 要求的 ``int32`` 数据类型和设备；实际写入由 setter 完成。如果当前 Tensor API "
"约定要求关节状态写入后刷新连杆变换，请调用 ``update_articulations_kinematic()`` 。并非每个 setter "
"都需要刷新，应遵循上游参考文档中各方法的行为。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:333
msgid "Access the contact view"
msgstr "访问接触视图"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:335
msgid ""
"The PhysX contact sensor exposes its native ``RigidContactView`` through "
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.sensors.ContactSensor.contact_view`. Use it when the "
"public sensor data does not expose the required contact details:"
msgstr ""
"PhysX 接触传感器通过 :attr:`~isaaclab_physx.sensors.ContactSensor.contact_view` "
"暴露原生 ``RigidContactView`` 。公共传感器数据无法提供所需接触细节时，可以使用此视图："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:346
msgid ""
"Other Isaac Lab sensors may use ordinary rigid-body or articulation views "
"internally, but those views are not sensor-specific low-level interfaces."
msgstr "其他 Isaac Lab 传感器内部可能使用普通刚体或关节体视图，但这些视图不是传感器专用的底层接口。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:350
msgid "Ownership, synchronization, and invalidation"
msgstr "所有权、同步与失效"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/physx.rst:352
msgid ""
"Preserve a view's expected selection ordering, device, dtype, and tensor "
"shape when supplying values to a setter. Check and reacquire views after a "
"hard reset, object removal, stage reload, or manager teardown. Prefer public"
" Isaac Lab sensor data when direct native contact or motion data is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"为 setter "
"提供值时，保持视图要求的选择顺序、设备、数据类型和张量形状。硬重置、对象移除、舞台重新加载或管理器清理后，应检查并重新获取视图。如果不需要直接访问原生接触或运动数据，应优先使用"
" Isaac Lab 公共传感器数据。"

